    {
      "source": "Create a new <code>R2dbcMappingContext</code> using <a href=\"../../relational/core/mapping/RelationalMappingContext.html#setForceQuote(boolean)\"><code>plain identifiers</code></a> and the given\n<a href=\"../../relational/core/mapping/NamingStrategy.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.relational.core.mapping\"><code>NamingStrategy</code></a>. Plain <a href=\"../../relational/core/sql/SqlIdentifier.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.relational.core.sql\"><code>identifiers</code></a> (i.e.\ntable and column names) are typically not case-sensitive (case-sensitivity can be still enforced by specific\ndatabase configurations).",
      "translation": "使用<a href=\"../../relational/core/mapping/RelationalMappingContext.html#setForceQuote(boolean)\"><code>plain identifiers</code></a>和给定的<a href=\"../../relational/core/mapping/NamingStrategy.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.relational.core.mapping\"><code>NamingStrategy</code></a>创建一个新的<code>R2dbcMappingContext</code>。普通的<a href=\"../../relational/core/sql/SqlIdentifier.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.relational.core.sql\"><code>identifiers</code></a>（即表和列名）通常不区分大小写（特定数据库配置仍可强制区分大小写）。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Create a new <code>R2dbcMappingContext</code> using <a href=\"../../relational/core/mapping/RelationalMappingContext.html#setForceQuote(boolean)\"><code>quoted identifiers</code></a> (default\nbehavior) and the given <a href=\"../../relational/core/mapping/NamingStrategy.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.relational.core.mapping\"><code>NamingStrategy</code></a>. Quoted\n<a href=\"../../relational/core/sql/SqlIdentifier.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.relational.core.sql\"><code>identifiers</code></a> (i.e. table and column names) are\ntypically case-sensitive.",
